# A new chat from the app: 令 in the bottom bar's notch, the new chat rising from the bottom; its first message makes
# the chat on the station (newChat.create, chat.send by its key) and the page becomes that chat in place; the agent
# answers there; back on Home, its row.
timeout 90000
until 端到端测试
tap icon:ling
until 想让 agent 做什么？
shot 1-new-chat
tap 做任何事
type 新对话来自 mbui {T} post:新对话里的回答 {T}
shot 2-typed
tap icon:arrow-up
until 新对话来自 mbui {T}
gone 想让 agent 做什么？
shot 3-became-chat
timeout 120000
until =新对话里的回答 {T}
shot 4-answered
tap icon:chevron-left
timeout 60000
until 新对话里的回答 {T}
until 端到端测试
shot 5-home
